                <pb facs="1033" n="937" sameAs="frus:frus1874/pg937"/>

                <head>No. 608.<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">General Sickles to Mr. Fish.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Madrid</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1873-11-14"><hi rendition="#italic">November</hi> 14,
                        1873</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Your cable of 12th, beginning “An official bulletin,” received early same day.
                    The other was delivered this morning. Yours of this date received at 10.30
                    to-night.</p>
                <closer><signed>SICKLES.</signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
